[{"id":46,"url":"a6c743d2-48df-4967-bb37-479189fedfa2","subject":"C\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng When v\u00e0 If","content":[{"contentHtml":"<p><strong>A.<\/strong> Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u v\u00ed d\u1ee5 sau:<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>A:\tWhat time will you call me tonight? (T\u1ed1i nay m\u1ea5y gi\u1edd b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd g\u1ecdi cho t\u00f4i \u0111\u1ea5y?)<\/p><p>B:\tI'll call you <strong>when I get<\/strong> home from work. (T\u00f4i s\u1ebd g\u1ecdi cho b\u1ea1n khi n\u00e0o t\u00f4i t\u1eeb c\u00f4ng ty v\u1ec1 t\u1edbi nh\u00e0.)<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>\t\u1ede \u0111\u00e2y c\u00e2u \" I'll call you when I get home from work \" c\u00f3 2 ph\u1ea7n:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Ph\u1ea7n ch\u00ednh<\/strong> l\u00e0 : <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\">I'll call you.<\/span><\/li><li><strong>Ph\u1ea7n v\u1edbi When<\/strong>: <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\">When I get home from work.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\t\u00dd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 c\u00e2u l\u00e0<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/span>, tuy nhi\u00ean ta kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong>Will <\/strong>hay <strong>Going to<\/strong> trong ph\u1ea7n v\u1edbi t\u1eeb <strong>When<\/strong>. Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 194, 102);\">th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i<\/span>, th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n (I do).<\/p>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"A."},{"insert":" Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u v\u00ed d\u1ee5 sau:\n\nA:\tWhat time will you call me tonight? (T\u1ed1i nay m\u1ea5y gi\u1edd b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd g\u1ecdi cho t\u00f4i \u0111\u1ea5y?)\nB:\tI'll call you "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"when I get"},{"insert":" home from work. (T\u00f4i s\u1ebd g\u1ecdi cho b\u1ea1n khi n\u00e0o t\u00f4i t\u1eeb c\u00f4ng ty v\u1ec1 t\u1edbi nh\u00e0.)\n\n\t\u1ede \u0111\u00e2y c\u00e2u \" I'll call you when I get home from work \" c\u00f3 2 ph\u1ea7n:\n"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Ph\u1ea7n ch\u00ednh"},{"insert":" l\u00e0 : "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff66"},"insert":"I'll call you."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Ph\u1ea7n v\u1edbi When"},{"insert":": "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff66"},"insert":"When I get home from work."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\t\u00dd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 c\u00e2u l\u00e0"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00"},"insert":" v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai"},{"insert":", tuy nhi\u00ean ta kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Will "},{"insert":"hay "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Going to"},{"insert":" trong ph\u1ea7n v\u1edbi t\u1eeb "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"When"},{"insert":". Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffc266"},"insert":"th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i"},{"insert":", th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n (I do).\n"}]},"images":[]},{"contentHtml":"<p>M\u1ed9t v\u00e0i v\u00ed d\u1ee5:<\/p><ul><li>I can't talk to you now. I'll talk to you later <strong>when I have<\/strong> more time.<\/li><li><strong>When the rain stops<\/strong>, we'll go out.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>Nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb c\u0169ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p nh\u01b0 When:<\/p><p>\t<strong>While<\/strong>\t<strong>After<\/strong>\t\t<strong>Before<\/strong>\t <strong>Until\/til<\/strong>\t<strong>As soon as<\/strong><\/p><p>v\u00ed d\u1ee5:<\/p><ul><li>Can you take care of the children <strong>while I am<\/strong> out?<\/li><li><strong>Before you leave<\/strong>, you must visit the museum.<\/li><li>Wait here <strong>until I come<\/strong> back.<\/li><\/ul>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"insert":"M\u1ed9t v\u00e0i v\u00ed d\u1ee5:\nI can't talk to you now. I'll talk to you later "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"when I have"},{"insert":" more time."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"When the rain stops"},{"insert":", we'll go out."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\nNh\u1eefng t\u1eeb c\u0169ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p nh\u01b0 When:\n\t"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"While"},{"insert":"\t"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"After"},{"insert":"\t\t"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Before"},{"insert":"\t "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Until\/til"},{"insert":"\t"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"As soon as"},{"insert":"\nv\u00ed d\u1ee5:\nCan you take care of the children "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"while I am"},{"insert":" out?"},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Before you leave"},{"insert":", you must visit the museum."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"Wait here "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"until I come"},{"insert":" back."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"}]},"images":[]},{"contentHtml":"<p><strong>B. <\/strong>Ta c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 194, 102);\">th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh<\/strong> (<strong>I have done<\/strong>) cho ph\u1ea7n c\u00e2u v\u1edbi <strong>When\/After\/Until<\/strong>, etc ,. , \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a ph\u1ea7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a c\u00e2u s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng trong ph\u1ea7n b\u1ed5 sung. V\u00ed d\u1ee5:<\/p><ul><li><strong>After I've read<\/strong> this book, you can have it.<\/li><li>Don't say anything while Tom is here. Wait <strong>until he has gone<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>Trong m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i c\u00e2u c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n ho\u1eb7c th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh.<\/p><ul><li>I'll come <strong>as soon as I finish<\/strong>. Ho\u1eb7c: I'll come <strong>as soon as I've finished<\/strong>.<\/li><li>You'll feel better<strong> when you have <\/strong>something to eat. Ho\u1eb7c: You'll feel better <strong>when you've had<\/strong> something to eat.<\/li><\/ul>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"B. "},{"insert":"Ta c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffc266","bold":true},"insert":"th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh"},{"insert":" ("},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"I have done"},{"insert":") cho ph\u1ea7n c\u00e2u v\u1edbi "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"When\/After\/Until"},{"insert":", etc ,. , \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a ph\u1ea7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a c\u00e2u s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng trong ph\u1ea7n b\u1ed5 sung. V\u00ed d\u1ee5:\n"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"After I've read"},{"insert":" this book, you can have it."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"Don't say anything while Tom is here. Wait "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"until he has gone"},{"insert":"."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\nTrong m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i c\u00e2u c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n ho\u1eb7c th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh.\nI'll come "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"as soon as I finish"},{"insert":". Ho\u1eb7c: I'll come "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"as soon as I've finished"},{"insert":"."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"You'll feel better"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":" when you have "},{"insert":"something to eat. Ho\u1eb7c: You'll feel better "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"when you've had"},{"insert":" something to eat."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"}]},"images":[]},{"contentHtml":"<p><strong>C. <\/strong>Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi If c\u0169ng v\u1eady, ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng tai.<\/p><ul><li>It's raining. We'll get wet<strong> if we go<\/strong> out.<\/li><li>Hurry up! <strong>If we don't hurry<\/strong>, we'll be late.<\/li><\/ul><p>Tuy nhi\u00ean h\u00e3y c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn vi\u1ec7c nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn gi\u1eefa <strong>When <\/strong>v\u00e0 <strong>If<\/strong>. <\/p><p>Ta d\u00f9ng <strong>When <\/strong>cho nh\u1eefng vi\u1ec7c m\u00e0 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn<\/span> x\u1ea3y ra:<\/p><ul><li>I'm going shopping this afternoon. <strong>When I go<\/strong> shopping, I'll buy some food.<\/li><\/ul><p>V\u1edbi <strong>If <\/strong>ta d\u00f9ng cho nh\u1eefng vi\u1ec7c m\u00e0 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">c\u00f3 th\u1ec3<\/span> s\u1ebd x\u1ea3y ra:<\/p><ul><li>I might go shopping this afternoon. <strong>If I go<\/strong> shopping, I'll buy some food.<\/li><li><strong>If it rains<\/strong> this evening. I won't go out.<\/li><li>Don't worry<strong> if I'm<\/strong> late to night.<\/li><li><strong>If he doesn't come<\/strong> soon, I'm not going to wait.<\/li><\/ul>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"C. "},{"insert":"Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi If c\u0169ng v\u1eady, ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng tai.\nIt's raining. We'll get wet"},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":" if we go"},{"insert":" out."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"Hurry up! "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"If we don't hurry"},{"insert":", we'll be late."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"Tuy nhi\u00ean h\u00e3y c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn vi\u1ec7c nh\u1ea7m l\u1ea